I read AGENTS.md first and performed only read-only inspection and metadata comparisons. I created no files and launched no builds, tests, containers, VMs or training. I read no private dataset/checkpoint/native2237 bodies or scientific transcripts.

Evidence supporting these decisions:

- Independently verified the byte lengths and SHA-256 pins for all nine supplied source/diff/export/compilation/synthetic metadata inputs. Reconstructed the unified diff from the before/after snapshots and obtained the supplied diff exactly.
