There is no blocking criterion-applicability finding. The two changed functions retain the same expressions and reductions. For finite, total validated inputs, forcing an `Int` prediction or `Double` loss to weak head normal form settles that scalar before traversal continues, without introducing reassociation or changing the value selected. Existing error branches remain unchanged. Supplied synthetic controls report equal output bits at 8/32/128 examples; actual edited-module observations support equality at 32/128 and matching empty/shape errors.

Strictness does change demand and failure timing. For example, an earlier partial scalar can now fail before a later example returns `Left`; arbitrary bottoms or invalid direct API inputs therefore do not have universal lazy observational equivalence. I found no validated-input numerical counterexample. The supplied finite controls do not prove every graph/backend case.

Synthetic held-result retention improves substantially: at 128 examples, legacy retained live heap is approximately 15.6 MB, versus approximately 1.46 MB for strict/edited-production observations. This supports the diagnosed lifetime mechanism only. The scalar-result list, input dataset and per-example forward peaks remain; neither constant-space evaluation nor production memory fit follows.

All inherited restrictions remain cumulative: five original ordered models, all outcomes retained, at least three same-model joint learning successes, whole-five statistics, predetermined served index zero, strict own-effective-initial gain, complete prescribed references and only the existing independently proved exact-optimum tie exceptions. Classification’s finite uniform-null control, regression’s exact finite comparisons, historical floor provenance and tuning’s context-only status retain their stated limits. No population-generalization or published-model-parity claim is created.

The ordinary DATA export proves exact exported contract equality; it confers no reviewer independence, execution, qualification, registration or admission authority. Coherent Linux compilation and retained seed metadata establish their declared compilation scope only.

